# CHANGELOG.md is generated by knope from the change files in .changeset/,
# whose prose is copied through verbatim. oxfmt normalises markdown emphasis
# to underscores, so a change file written with *asterisks* fails this
# package's format gate — and it fails inside the release PR, long after the
# change file itself was reviewed, where the cause is far from obvious
# (release PR #329).
#
# The formatter is here to keep hand-written source consistent. This file is
# output, and which emphasis marker it uses renders identically on npmjs.com,
# so there is nothing worth gating. Authored markdown in this package (README
# and the docs under src/) is still checked.
#
# oxfmt reads .gitignore and .prettierignore from the working directory by
# default; format:check runs per package, so this lives beside package.json
# rather than at the workspace root.
CHANGELOG.md
